diagnose, treat, prevent injury, establish readiness, or guarantee transfer."},"athleteSupport":{"whyItMatters":"Candidate practice for finding a quiet, controlled bilateral landing position without adding a jump, rebound, or external-height load.","primaryCue":"Start tall, drop quietly into your landing shape, and freeze the finish.","secondaryCues":["bend through ankles, knees, and hips together","keep both feet grounded and knees tracking over the middle toes","arrive without a jump, heel lift, bounce, or extra shift","stand, reset, and report symptoms"],"expectedSensations":["light-to-moderate thigh, hip, calf, foot, and trunk control effort","brief attention to quiet position acquisition and balance"],"unexpectedSensations":["pain, giving way, heel lift, knee/trunk collapse, loud contact, imbalance, dizziness, or inability to hold"],"painGuidance":"Stop rather than forcing depth or a hold through pain, instability, dizziness, or another concerning symptom; report it and follow facility escalation policy.","selfChecks":["started tall without a preparatory jump","arrived with both feet grounded and quiet","held the declared landing shape","did not rebound, shift, travel, or take off","no stop rule occurred"],"accessibility":{"captionsRequired":true,"transcriptRequired":true,"stillSequenceRequired":true,"audioDescriptionRequired":true},"mediaAlternatives":{"captionsRequired":true,"transcriptRequired":true,"stillSequenceRequired":true,"audioDescriptionRequired":true,"humanReviewRequired":true,"approvedMediaAvailable":false}},"coachSupport":{"observationChecklist":["exact non-jump bilateral task, arm-action modifier, surface, clearance, and no-rebound boundary","feet, ankle/knee/hip sharing, knee/trunk control, contact sound, terminal hold, balance, and side asymmetry","valid repetitions, first fault, symptoms, rest, and downstream lower-body exposure"],"faultCorrections":{"preparatory_jump":"slow the lowering and rehearse a tall non-jump start","heel_lift_or_reach"